<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/sequence.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                             dcterms:description "Represents an ordered sequence of entities where each element follows another."^^xsd:string ;
                                                             dcterms:title "Sequence Pattern"^^xsd:string ;
                                                             rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x2; term declared x2;
- header: dcterms:title \"Sequence Pattern\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en ,
                                                                          "Represents an ordered sequence of entities where each element follows another."^^xsd:string ;
                                                             rdfs:label "Sequence Pattern"^^xsd:string .

